    "promoTitle": "Mastering-Grade Precision. Swiss Soul.",
    "promoSubtitle": "The Grammy-winning Weiss lineage, distilled into its most potent, focused desktop DAC yet.",
    "promoText": "True transparency isn't just about what you hear—it’s about what you finally stop missing. Born from the legendary studio processors used to master the world’s most iconic records, the Weiss DAC204 brings surgical precision to your desktop without the clinical coldness.\n\nBy stripping away the screens, menus, and fluff, Weiss has funneled every cent of its Swiss engineering into a singular goal: bit-perfect conversion. Featuring a multi-config output stage that effortlessly drives any high-end amplifier and a proprietary jitter-reduction system that redefines digital timing, the DAC204 doesn't just play your music—it uncovers the original master tape hidden within your files. Compact, tactile, and uncompromising, it is the definitive source for the serious headphone listener."
  },
